ndomly assigned a different body part to draw, and when time runs out, your <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">monstrosity</span></strong>\u00a0MASTERPIECE is assembled before your eyes! Save your creations to your own private gallery or post them online for all to see. You can also play solo! (1-4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618320/extras/e95edd696d374f9b631f4f0b30b90982.poster.avif?t=1752217632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618320/extras/e95edd696d374f9b631f4f0b30b90982.webm?t=1752217632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618320/extras/e95edd696d374f9b631f4f0b30b90982.mp4?t=1752217632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PERSONALISE YOUR GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a range of awesome textured backgrounds to doodle on across all four game modes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No microtransactions. No Subscriptions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618320/extras/4ebbccbd844c358912d0fae65b965d8a.poster.avif?t=1752217632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618320/extras/4ebbccbd844c358912d0fae65b965d8a.webm?t=1752217632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ACHIEVEMENT HUNTERS WELCOME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doodle Champs has <strong>100</strong>  fun achievements to collect!!\u00a0<i>Got what it takes to unlock 'em all?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://